  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-12a-2013-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The legs of right triangle \\(ABE\\) are \\(AB = 10\\) and \\(BE.\\) From \\(\\tfrac12\\cdot 10\\cdot BE = 40,\\) we get \\(BE = 8.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
